{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "857d9a0f-0188-5ee8-8be4-ecb41cd19efb", "source_ordinal": 1147, "reading_ordinal": 2910, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "没影响", "published_at": "2024-11-02T05:09:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1566098757/answer/20759160870"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "没什么影响。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "再过个个把月，还在兴冲冲纠缠这些事的小男生们会开始挨家人的训斥了。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "还在对妻子、恋人炫耀“武功”、寻求支持的，就要遇到反弹、开始吵架了。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为身边人对这种不知分寸的孩子气的容忍是有限度的。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "在无关者眼里，这并不可爱，也谈不上勇敢，更和正义沾不上什么边。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这种运动自我想象的“广泛支持”根本就不存在，自己彼此鼓吹的“重大影响”也不过是幻觉。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所谓的“女拳”根本就不是什么“女性扩权的工具”，而是女性凭借宪法承诺的推进，逐渐获得更加独立的经济地位和社会地位、逐渐获得正常的社会成员的权利之后，不再对男性的统治唯唯诺诺、投鼠忌器的正常心理转变中较为具有攻击性的一部分。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "说得直白点，旧社会女性没有男性保护，出门会被抢劫、寡居会被欺凌、没有独立拥有财产的资格，所以只好对一切男性的霸凌低三下四、委曲求全、逆来顺受、伏低做小。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "现在社会变了，人家自己赚钱了，谁敢强奸有警察了，谁敢霸凌有法院了，不求人了，不怕了，说话硬气了，大声了。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而尤其棘手的是，女性中有很强的心理冲动，想要享有男性原来享有的攻击权。", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你们现在羞愤难当的所谓“女拳言论”，事实上在过去两千年里在男性中早已习以为常，视为天经地义，甚至至今随时脱口而出，自己根本毫无察觉，还觉得自己已经很“文雅”、很“礼貌”，甚至很“温柔”了。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "那些侮辱女人、蔑视女人甚至污蔑女人的话，大多数男性不但没有敏感性，还觉得这是“情趣”，是“喜欢你才逗你”。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "男性们大谈着“女司机”“女上司”“女人多了的组织”，仿佛茶余饭后无伤大雅的娱乐。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "现在女性们之中有着一个强烈的心理冲动——那就是既然男女平等，那么男人能犯的错误，我们为什么不能犯？", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我们也要视此为无伤大雅。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我们也要像男人嘲弄、蔑视、侮辱女性一样，平等的拥有这样嘲弄、蔑视、侮辱的权利。", "char_start": 708, "char_end": 747}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我先说清楚——这绝对是一个错误的想法。", "char_start": 748, "char_end": 767}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "姑娘们，不要把这种行为本身视为一种权利，你们自己不去攫取这项权利，才能有充分的力量去反击、驳斥、抑制、纠正男性承袭了几千年的恶习。", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 833}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但如果你们对此感到疲劳、沮丧、绝望，要来个反其道而行之，即放弃“我不能，你也不能”的对称，转而走向“既然你能，那么我也能”的对称，这将是没有尽头的无限损失。", "char_start": 834, "char_end": 912}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为世界上真正的争斗，绝不是战争的一方去战胜战争的另一方，这种所谓的战胜，只会不断的向新任的赢家和输家双双证明暴力的威力，进一步加深双方对暴力的毒瘾，让战争这种最大的悲剧无限的延续。事实上，只要战争没有以和解结束，无论谁赢谁输，双方都是暴力毒瘾的输家。", "char_start": 913, "char_end": 1039}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一切的战争，真正的胜利只能存在于双方反对暴力的人对双方执着暴力的人之间，是和平与战争本身的斗争。", "char_start": 1040, "char_end": 1088}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "是要双方追求和平的力量，通过和平、合作的示范，让双方执着于斗争最终遍体鳞伤、濒危垂死的同类意识到自己的荒唐和错误，这才是真正你要、也是你应该追求的结局。", "char_start": 1089, "char_end": 1165}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "因此，请不要选择“既然你能，那我也能”，而要在对方积习难改的前提下，坚定的站在“我不要，你也不要”“你不能，我也不能”的这一边。", "char_start": 1166, "char_end": 1230}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这当然是极为困难的，甚至是“违反人性”的。", "char_start": 1231, "char_end": 1252}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "但其实人性并非人的习性中兽性的部分，而是其中神性的部分。", "char_start": 1253, "char_end": 1281}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "越是拥抱兽性，放纵基于“同态复仇”的所谓正义观，你们反而会正中了兽性的轨迹，成为延续暴力对抗的不由自主的帮凶，反而亲手制造和延长自己的痛苦和灾难，无限的迁延真正更美好的未来降临的时间。", "char_start": 1282, "char_end": 1374}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不要这么做，再说一遍，不要这么做。不要心怀激愤，总是想着“既然你能，为什么我不能”——你们要知道，男性的文化没那么快转变，他们是暂时不能清晰的意识到自己是如何已经失礼的，所以在你们眼里的“合理反击”，在他们眼里却是“无端挑衅”。", "char_start": 1375, "char_end": 1489}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这必然会引发无限的“正当防卫”，进入连环膝跳反应——你一脚踢在我的膝跳神经上导致我控制不住一脚踢到你的膝跳神经上，结成一对无限恶化的死循环。", "char_start": 1490, "char_end": 1560}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "撇开所谓的正义观，这首先在实践上指向严重亏损，而不是避损、止损，更不谈指望收益了。", "char_start": 1561, "char_end": 1602}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你们要赢——我是指真正的、历史性地、决定性的赢得健康的、可持续的平等——必须采用别的策略来消化自己受到这类“惯性侮辱”的痛苦。", "char_start": 1603, "char_end": 1666}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "第一个要害——是你们要善于建设友好的小环境，然后在自己严守温柔、礼貌的前提下，严厉的筛选剔除尚未明白平等、尊重的具体实践的成员，不论男女。", "char_start": 1667, "char_end": 1736}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "在这个得到严厉维护的友好环境里，有美好的感情可能和可以抵抗、消解焦虑的社会性供给，这本身就会成为这个纷乱、焦虑的世界的洞天福地。", "char_start": 1737, "char_end": 1801}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "于是禁止和剥夺滥用暴力——哪怕是无意识的、文化惯性性质的暴力——的人的加入资格本身，就足以平衡你们受到这类侵犯时的委屈和痛苦。", "char_start": 1802, "char_end": 1865}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你们能在自己身边创造乐园，那么手握乐园的密码，驱逐恶客，就是对执着、沉迷甚至仅仅是不承担与恶习斗争的天然义务的人的最好的、最恰如其分的、最不可抗拒的报复。", "char_start": 1866, "char_end": 1943}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "是这个——而不是以眼还眼、以牙还牙——才是你们真正的取胜之道。", "char_start": 1944, "char_end": 1975}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "让沉迷丛林的人继续“享受丛林”，去拥有奖励的能力，去奖励那些真诚努力与自己的兽性搏斗、拼尽全力向你们张开白羽的人。", "char_start": 1976, "char_end": 2033}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "让这些人得温暖、得照顾、得信任、得帮助，让丛林爱好者们去抓耳挠腮，纠结怎么得到门票。", "char_start": 2034, "char_end": 2076}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "这才是正道。", "char_start": 2077, "char_end": 2083}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "而行这道的力量，全在温柔的能力和对兽性的慧眼上。", "char_start": 2084, "char_end": 2108}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "不是以牙还牙的能力上。", "char_start": 2109, "char_end": 2120}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "你们看懂没有？", "char_start": 2121, "char_end": 2128}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "好吧，说着说着又说到姑娘们身上去了。", "char_start": 2130, "char_end": 2148}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "回头来说男性们。", "char_start": 2149, "char_end": 2157}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "不要去听信什么“女性在通过有意支持女拳夺取男性的正当权利”这种鬼话，你只要听信这个，你是真的没救了，至少这些话你恐怕是听不进去了，也只能让你在只有母狼出没的丛林里再继续一段历险记自己修炼了。", "char_start": 2158, "char_end": 2253}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "所谓的“女拳”，根本就不是什么“女性扩权的工具”。女性根本不需要这些鬼蜮伎俩，因为女性的平等工作机会、平等代表权，是通过在缔造新中国的历史进程中不可磨灭、不可抹杀的历史贡献被铸造在底层社会契约之中的，她们仅仅只需要堂堂正正的通过法定组织、正当程序，推动、参与、监督、问责各级行政机关的工作，去保证宪法承诺的不断落实就可以了。", "char_start": 2254, "char_end": 2416}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "事实上不但不是“女权在借用女拳的威”，反而恰恰是“女拳在盗用女权的势”，你们整个的倒果为因、本末倒置了。", "char_start": 2417, "char_end": 2469}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "女拳仅仅是对女权的不恰当利用罢了，但平心而论，真的摸摸良心，你非要全体女性对一个几千年从未获得过的历史性权利从一开始就能做到不偏不倚、完美恰当地运用，这是完全不明智、也是根本做不到的。", "char_start": 2470, "char_end": 2562}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "尤其是在男性们自己还在严重缺乏严肃自觉的、堪称肆无忌惮的继续滥用自己从强烈的男性统治文化里继承下来的无数“传统”的前提下，要女性们连杨笠这个级别的失范也不许有、要号召，要动员对这种级别的过失处以极刑，不但要其本人社会性死亡，甚至还要连坐、要“夷三族”——你们自己坐稳了想想，有理智的社会成员、有一点基本是非观的人，谁不对此齿冷？", "char_start": 2563, "char_end": 2727}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "这样干的人不是主流，哪怕现在声势再浩大，也必然不可能成为历史主流，只会必然的被谋求最大和谐的社会自身反对和扬弃。", "char_start": 2728, "char_end": 2784}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "我知道你们有些人现在还听不进去，但最后真正告诉你结果的，不会是我，而是丛林本身。", "char_start": 2785, "char_end": 2825}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "至于那些被放在准星里，正被人准备夷的“三族”，这么说吧——你们只管试。", "char_start": 2826, "char_end": 2861}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "你们卖吧，只要股价真的因你们下跌了，肯定有人买。", "char_start": 2862, "char_end": 2886}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "因为这是送钱赚。", "char_start": 2887, "char_end": 2895}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 56}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0422"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：京东这个事件，如果京东选择硬抗到底，会对京东有什么影响呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053"], "summary": "围绕“没影响”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“没什么影响。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "没什么影响。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d49c81f1-41ac-5540-b654-eb32492ccf33", "source_ordinal": 1146, "reading_ordinal": 2911, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "几时崩溃", "published_at": "2024-11-02T13:44:01+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2367708691/answer/21037796641"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不知何时，流行起了一种堪称“崩溃期待强迫症”的现象。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不光是俄乌战场上如此，也在中美竞争中、台海局势中、“性别斗争”中等等等等几乎一切的激烈对抗中，都在流行这种执念。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“崩溃”好啊，一来痛快，二来可以清晰的标志胜利——仅仅是一天下滑一毫米，或者“三天前进两毫米，两天又倒退一毫米”的无限磨损，实在是缺少胜利感。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "没有胜利感，赢都赢得不满足。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "问题的关键是：“只把对方的崩溃看成胜利的唯一有效形式”，是否有利于提升你获得胜利的概率？这才是考虑一切问题的根本逻辑。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "首先，抱着这个执念，你的焦虑程度会远比没有这个执念来得强，因为你会对一毫米的胜利忽略不计，从而导致长期缺乏积极的心理收益。类似“要吃就要吃年夜饭，不是年夜饭就不吃”，那就要一饿饿一年，你多半熬不住。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "其次，这会导致你出于渴望纵容幻觉，天天执着于寻找对方“即将崩溃”的迹象，以至于容易放大相关的蛛丝马迹。长期保持，会严重的影响你对客观情况的有效判断。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你要正确的认识到——崩溃式的失败虽然存在，但那必然是因为对手穷尽了“软着陆”的手段和资源的结果，而以现代知识、技术、资源和监控手段，任何严肃的对手要无知到不能预料崩溃的机制、迟钝到无法监控崩溃压力的出现、资源匮乏到黔驴技穷、无计可施，都是概率很小而且无比漫长的过程。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "现在跟低技术条件、低管理经验的前现代是两个时代了，不要对古典风格的“崩溃”有太强的期待。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "坚持一毫米一毫米的前进，并且为此感到满意。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "做一只蜗牛车手，为时速一毫米的狂飙感到兴奋和满足，这恰恰反而是现代的“赢家气质”。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 648}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "有了这样的觉悟，你才可以真正健康的观察对手崩溃的迹象，对这个作出恰当的，而不是“情人眼里出西施”式的过于放大的判断，才可以在无限的耐心之中坚持到“对手的崩溃出乎意料的提前到来”，而不是在对“迟迟未来的胜利”的焦虑等待中提前绝望。", "char_start": 649, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "在俄乌战争中，乌克兰真正的危机并不在于何时完全失去四州的领土控制权，而在于俄罗斯完全占据这四州后，战争热度是否真的可以冷却。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "就怕俄罗斯留着个尾巴，一直拖延和谈，在政治上不断的制造两难，逼着乌克兰面对“这要接受了，跟全面投降也没有本质区别了”的艰难条件，以至于无法选择主动停战。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 904}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "从一开始我们就分析过了——如果仅仅只夺得四州，而不能彻底的解决乌克兰人对北约、对美西方的一切幻想，不打出一个提到美西方就咬牙切齿的愤恨的乌克兰，这场战争就算得到了所谓的领土，在政治上仍然是失败的。", "char_start": 905, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "所以，真正的悬念是“四州平定之后，这场战争要如何继续”的问题。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1035}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而乌克兰在到达这一关键节点之前出现大崩溃的可能性并不大，甚至即使过了这一节点，战争继续持续，也不太可能在短期内出现乌克兰大崩溃。", "char_start": 1036, "char_end": 1100}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0422"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：乌克兰近期在乌东连失战略要地，是不是即将迎来总崩溃？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“几时崩溃”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不知何时，流行起了一种堪称“崩溃期待强迫症”的现象。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不知何时，流行起了一种堪称“崩溃期待强迫症”的现象。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "54537c0e-3b0a-59cc-ac8c-4c31c2385e6e", "source_ordinal": 1145, "reading_ordinal": 2912, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "漫堤之日", "published_at": "2024-11-03T05:21:52+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/615951596/answer/21493502406"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这话这么说吧——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "会这么说话的男性，建议女性远离；", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "会痴迷于这话的女性，也建议男性远离。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人是无法适应豢养关系的。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "豢养人的，没可能一直不将自己的人格凌驾于对方之上；受人豢养的，没可能一直将自己的人格屈于对方之下。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "即使是亲生的父母子女之间，长期维持豢养关系，也会生出破天的怨恨，而且最危险的是，这种怨恨是长期引而不发，一但发作就控制不住直奔咽喉心肝致命处来。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一个自以为对人有天大的恩情，另一个却觉得身负忍无可忍的凌辱，彼此间对同一体验的结论有无可调和甚至不共戴天的差异，一旦忍无可忍，就会像修得过高却没有泄洪闸的拦河大坝——必有漫堤一天，而漫堤的那一天，大坝必然毁灭。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而这可怕的劫难最可怕的地方，就在于刚建成的时候似乎风调雨顺、立竿见影。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以即使这样明明警告，也拦不住侥幸的人要这样去做。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "各安天命吧。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 355}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0422"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：论男性一句「我养你」对女性杀伤力有多大?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“漫堤之日”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这话这么说吧——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这话这么说吧——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0b0dc7b1-32a0-51f7-b3fa-64af33797853", "source_ordinal": 1144, "reading_ordinal": 2913, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "真人不语", "published_at": "2024-11-03T07:47:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/653334528/answer/21523835548"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这叫啥话，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我不是人？", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你这不就遇到了？", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "遇到了你想咋样？", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "真诚仅仅意味着实话实说，没有坑你的打算。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这既不意味着对你有求必应，也不意味着容你侵犯隐私，甚至都不见得意味着友好热情，随便容人套近乎。", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "甚至恰恰相反，正因为没有坑你的打算，所以格外崖岸高峻、坚城深池、戒备森严。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "甚至——你可能要大感意外——对你冷若冰霜、据之于千里之外的，有很大比例恰恰正是真诚的人。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "真诚不是热诚，是没有“温暖友善”属性的。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不但不见得热诚，反而往往极大概率会给你强烈的冷淡感，因为这类人开口就是精准、优质的真实情报，言必有物、言必有中，所以绝不会轻易给人机会来卖好套话。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为ta们每一个都吃过足够的教训。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "“真诚”和“没有严防信息泄露的意识”合起来，等如小儿持和氏璧过闹市。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "慢藏诲盗，必引贪鬼无算。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这不光是容易遭人索取、利用的问题，还有一重更大的忌讳——其实人类承受真相的能力极为有限，ta又非要问，问了ta又痛苦、纠结、逃避，继而要迁怒，要贰过，要报复。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "求的是ta，狂傲在前；怨的也ta，背信在后。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "所以真人不轻语。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你遇得到，很真，但你遇得到还要受得住真相，还要有资格开口。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不是遇到难，是开口难，是受住难。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而你既然在哀叹为什么遇不到，现在就可以免费的送你一个真相——", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你遇到过，只是你都被判定为不及格，所以当面错过了。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 558}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "看到没，这就是真诚。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你现在喉头涌起的这股心血，就是得到真诚的感觉。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 594}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "咽下去，不要吐出来。", "char_start": 595, "char_end": 605}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "咽下去你就转运。", "char_start": 606, "char_end": 614}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0422"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么越长大越遇不到真诚的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“真人不语”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这叫啥话，”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这叫啥话，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c0b27ae9-ce30-5fa3-8cd6-1b47f116bc76", "source_ordinal": 1143, "reading_ordinal": 2914, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "谁来同情", "published_at": "2024-11-03T17:30:28+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/661057120/answer/21925509448"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一个人如果要有点出息，必须要养成一个习惯，就是永远不把自己遭遇的任何问题的原因总结到“xx不够同情我”上。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人类的确有同情同类的天然义务，但监督这个天然义务得到执行的只能是人自己的心理本能，而不能是任何其他人类——包括所谓的“应被同情者”本人。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是人对上天承担的义务，受上天监管，只对上天交代，不是人对你承担的义务，不受你监管，不对你交代。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你没有把问题总结为谁谁不够同情你的资格和权柄。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "并且，恰恰会因为你这么做了，你还会格外的丧失资格。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你这么做，更大的概率是外人不但不觉得你没有受到应有的同情，反而觉得你是贪得无厌、逃避自己基本的生存责任。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你有相信“我已经得到了该有的同情、现状已经是我得到了应有同情的结果”的义务，只有在你始终善尽这个义务的前提下，你才能始终对事态做出真正有力、有效的回应。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你才会真正的得到更多的人的额外优待和帮助。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为人也有奖励社会性的本能义务，天生的愿意看到可以抱怨但不抱怨、可以推卸责任但不推卸的人有好的结果，不愿看到ta们落空、受挫、转化为社会的敌人，因为这是全社会的共同损失。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "反过来，让一个凡事都喜欢往其他社会成员——哪怕仅仅是一部分社会成员——不够同情自己上总结、总是想着向其他人强征赋税来解决自己的问题的人——哪怕你人多势众——得逞，同样也是社会的共同失败。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这跟让恐怖分子拿到了赎金一样失败。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以人人得而诛之，都要忍不住上来踩你两脚。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这类“不够同情”的审判，如果说谁可以下，那么绝不是自认为没得到同情的你自己，而只能来自本该同情你的对方的良心自责、来自利益无关方的自发批评。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 664}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "丢掉这种只会为自己招来雷击和诅咒的愚蠢企图，去干点正事。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 693}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0422"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：90后老师越来越多，按理说这些老师的读书生涯应该跟现在的学生能够共情，但为什么教育环境并没多大改变？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“谁来同情”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一个人如果要有点出息，必须要养成一个习惯，就是永远不把自己遭遇的任何问题的原因总结到“xx不够同情我”上。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一个人如果要有点出息，必须要养成一个习惯，就是永远不把自己遭遇的任何问题的原因总结到“xx不够同情我”上。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 53, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5c0dd5ad-9e27-586b-ab3d-02dc72de921b", "source_ordinal": 1142, "reading_ordinal": 2915, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "强电近地", "published_at": "2024-11-04T11:04:14+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2920707420/answer/22441751203"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“强电近地”是一种电器行业的禁忌。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这跟散热关系并不大。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "散热不佳，最多自动关机，要是有意外泼溅，大量饮料、酒水、宠物尿液、房屋积水溅入强电源，可能导致人身伤害甚至火灾，这根本不是一个级别的威胁。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因此，无论多低位安装的电源，都有必要安装到猫狗可以尿到的高度以上，或在做不到的前提下越高越好。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "地插必须自带保险和防泼溅、浸泡设计。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "否则宠物、儿童之类的意外因素的普遍存在可能成为重大安全隐患。", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 196}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0422"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么电脑厂商用了二十多年时间才发现电源应该放在机箱下部？电源下置这么显而易见的结构这么晚才出现？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“强电近地”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““强电近地”是一种电器行业的禁忌。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“强电近地”是一种电器行业的禁忌。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3683f23d-4d5d-509e-b1b3-2db4a4513244", "source_ordinal": 1141, "reading_ordinal": 2916, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "爱在珍珠港", "published_at": "2024-11-04T22:17:48+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/662447145/answer/22980927170"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "没有爱，样样都重要，怎么也要有一样。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有爱，都不重要。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "问题是，学爱、信爱、行爱，比整容、学习性技巧、赚钱、学会甜言蜜语的套路、围着对方转加起来都难。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "爱是一次性保证全部问题都有解，是一种战略性的解决方案，有爱作为前提主要是有两大福利——第一，具体的战术、技术都可以事半功倍（但这绝不意味着无需任何战术努力）；第二，这些努力的边际效用是递增的，就是会像酿酒一样，年份越高，会有自然增值，感情稳定性会越来越强。别小看这个越来越强，强到一定程度，护身光环可以直接压制低级恐惧，遇到问题不用思考怎么应对，对方自动补强，直接把问题自行消灭了。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "没有爱打底，纯技术性的头痛医头、脚痛医脚，第一是事倍功半，第二是很多解决手段互相矛盾，解决A的手段直接会把问题B恶化，直接导致两个问题无法同时解决。第三是这些问题越应付、手段越趋向无效，需要不断花样翻新的折腾。而即使你折腾得越来越巧妙，也越来越难弥补对方自动补恶产生的源源不绝的疑心暗鬼。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但后者有一个好处——不需要年深日久的看掉几千个问题的答案，也不需要日复一日的反思、去持续不断的认识自己的错误。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "爱是容不得“自我感觉良好”的，容不得你觉得“错不在我”，容不得你觉得“老子底牌多”的——而偏偏，大多数人一分钟也离不开这些“自信”傍身。逼着ta们放弃这些“自信”，如同夺其钱财、杀其父母，那是万万不能。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这一条就把做不到的人通向爱的路堵死了，既然堵死了，只好追求“潘、驴、邓、小、闲”了；既然只剩“潘、驴、邓、小、闲”了，就只好坚信“潘、驴、邓、小、闲”就是完全充分的手段了。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人就会说“什么爱，无非潘驴邓小闲罢了”这样的话。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "其实这些全不重要。", "char_start": 683, "char_end": 692}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "可惜，这事的最大困难，在于你如果不信，你就看不到何以它可信，你也就信不了。", "char_start": 693, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你就只能在对潘驴邓小闲的迷信中打转，直到十几年后，潘驴邓小闲都穷尽了，还是力竭崩溃，泼天大败，你再来承认它其实不行，只够撑到珍珠港，却撑不过东京大轰炸。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 807}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "单论珍珠港，堪称军事奇迹，但看出来了吗？这种军事奇迹却本质上是亡国之道。", "char_start": 808, "char_end": 844}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“潘驴邓小闲”论，本质上就是在激烈的讨论怎么打好珍珠港。", "char_start": 845, "char_end": 873}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你只是跟昭和参谋们说不通罢了。", "char_start": 874, "char_end": 889}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0422"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女生觉得“潘、驴、邓、小、闲”哪个最重要？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“爱在珍珠港”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“没有爱，样样都重要，怎么也要有一样。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "没有爱，样样都重要，怎么也要有一样。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1af03944-f907-5af3-b262-521cca45216e", "source_ordinal": 1140, "reading_ordinal": 2917, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "反便宜", "published_at": "2024-11-04T22:35:37.063000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/69495e0a993711ef8a8f5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "感觉自己从小到大，总是会被人占便宜。举一个初中时的遭际：我们班上有个贫困生，女，学习成绩不错，但爱占便宜，比如有同学带面包到学校吃，她连招呼都不打，直接往别人面包上咬一口。我个子矮，我妈妈听别人说多喝牛奶长个子，让我上学时每天喝两盒250ml的纯牛奶。然后那个女生向我要一盒喝，她对我说：“家里穷买不起，你给我喝一瓶吧，反正你多的是”我一想她是贫困生，就给了她一盒。没想到第二天她又问我要了。我又是不会拒绝的人，所以又给了。就这样，我足足给她供了一个学期的牛奶，算算也不少钱了。下学期，我终于鼓起勇气拒绝她了，她说我小气，然后我们就再也不来往了。现在长大后，也经常遇到类似的事情。我一拒绝，她们就会说", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 348, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不要拒绝。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要换一个形式。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "比如对方要牛奶，那么你就说“这样吧，我用牛奶换你的饼，行不行”。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你选的这样东西要比ta索要的这件东西明显便宜。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如果对方说“饼不换”，那么你就问ta还有什么可以跟你换，可以提出来看看你有没有兴趣。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "对方提得出，不管是什么，只要不离谱，你都可以跟ta换。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "对方提不出，你就说“那下次你带个饼来跟我换吧，我也想尝尝你家附近的那个饼”。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "然后你找机会，趁ta不在，把牛奶放ta桌上。ta再问你是不是你放的，你不要承认。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "到这里就是一个完整的循环——", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一切的“求施舍”，都会被你自动强制转换为“求交易”，没有例外。我的善意仅限于对你的交换物给出宽容的条件。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 638}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果你拒绝这个替代提议，我们不能合作的责任和过失必然在你，因为整个社会都会不由自主的代入我的角色而不是你的角色——ta们很清楚，ta们更可能成为下一个我，而不是下一个你。", "char_start": 639, "char_end": 724}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以社会无法站在你的立场上来剥夺我的利益，只要这么做了，ta们自己就会立刻受到报应。", "char_start": 725, "char_end": 767}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而一切的施舍、慈善，我以不具名为对价，不容你抗拒的换取不接受任何点餐、定制需求的自由。", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 811}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这就是这一整个循环要传递的信息。", "char_start": 812, "char_end": 828}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个循环还有一个尾巴——那就是以后要换，ta需要预先先提出来，先让你同意，因为这个饼吃过了，我不想再吃了。", "char_start": 829, "char_end": 882}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这意思是我要把自由定价权保留，一事一议。这一次我慷慨的用牛奶换了你明显更便宜的饼，只是让你尝个甜头，意识到我作为良好交易者对你的潜在价值。但我会预先打消你“以后只要拿出一个饼就能换一盒牛奶”的预期。", "char_start": 883, "char_end": 982}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不，是每次你要牛奶，你要出的价你无法事先确定。你将无法断言你的交易成本一定可控。", "char_start": 983, "char_end": 1023}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "事实上，从下一次开始，我提出的对价不会低于我的成本。", "char_start": 1024, "char_end": 1050}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果你敢抱怨，那么问题就变成“已经得到了一次便宜，却还不知足”，所有的第三方又要自动代入我的立场来斥责你——原理还是一样，ta们更可能是下一个我而不是下一个你。", "char_start": 1051, "char_end": 1131}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这样，你就可以始终领先一步占住主导权，不断的将ta所有可能的选择都引向以下共同的终点：", "char_start": 1132, "char_end": 1175}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "1）你通过优惠价格展现了必要的友善，而不是通过被迫施舍展现了不必要的软弱。", "char_start": 1176, "char_end": 1213}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "2）你建立了健康的交易先例和关系规则。", "char_start": 1214, "char_end": 1233}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "3）你通过出其不意的捐赠，在最坏的一种可能性里，尽可能有效的压制了对方的怨恨，而又堵死了对方贪婪的通道。", "char_start": 1234, "char_end": 1286}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "4）你的每一步都威慑和管理住了对方一切可能的反制，如果对方或者观众中有识货的，自然知道你——或者你背后的家庭、参谋——绝不是可以轻易挑衅的人物。", "char_start": 1287, "char_end": 1359}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你会获得敬畏。", "char_start": 1360, "char_end": 1367}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "如果你做得妥当，你很可能得到一份带有敬畏和健康默契的友谊，这就是你为什么要用这个策略而不是单纯去考虑“如何坚定的拒绝”的原因。", "char_start": 1368, "char_end": 1431}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "或者换一个角度——这个方案就是你要寻找的“正确的拒绝”，只是它没有预设结论、提前阉割掉拒绝之外的其他美好的可能性。", "char_start": 1432, "char_end": 1489}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这就是标准答案，不用另寻了。", "char_start": 1491, "char_end": 1505}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0422"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：被别人多次占便宜后，怎样拒绝别人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“反便宜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“感觉自己从小到大，总是会被人占便宜。举一个初中时的遭际：我们班上有个贫困生，女，学习成绩不错，但爱占便宜，比如有同学带面包到学校吃，她连招呼都不打，直接往别人面包上咬一口。我个子矮，我妈妈听别人说多喝牛奶长个子，让我上学时每天喝两盒250ml的纯牛奶。然后那个女生向我要一盒喝，她对我说：“家里穷买不起，你给我喝一瓶吧，反正你多的是”我一想她是贫困生，就给了她”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "感觉自己从小到大，总是会被人占便宜。举一个初中时的遭际：我们班上有个贫困生，女，学习成绩不错，但爱占便宜，比如有同学带面包到学校吃，她连招呼都不打，直接往别人面包上咬一口。我个子矮，我妈妈听别人说多喝牛奶长个子，让我上学时每天喝两盒250ml的纯牛奶。然后那个女生向我要一盒喝，她对我说：“家里穷买不起，你给我喝一瓶吧，反正你多的是”我一想她是贫困生，就给了她", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 348, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
